            "unit_id": "d4148dd852cee.u21.3779",
            "quote": "On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:"
          }
        ],
        "rationale": "An operative designation is the question's second classification route."
      },
      "executable_correspondence": {
        "status": "PRESERVES",
        "representation_quotes": [
          "operative_sfc_designation: Whether an SFC case-by-case designation of this Fund as a complex product under this circular is operative at the assessment time. Mere designation risk or missing records does not establish either truth value. (Boolean)",
          "Result: at least one of these conditions holds: [the fact aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav; the fact operative_sfc_designation]"
        ],
        "rationale": "The executable OR preserves designation as an independent route, including below 50%. It consumes an operative decision; it does not implement or confer the SFC's discretion."
      },
      "authority": {
        "status": "NONE_DECLARED",
        "dependency_ids": [],
        "rationale": "The circular establishes this permission. A particular Fund's designation decision is application evidence, not additional authority needed to support the general claim."
      },
      "followup_questions": [
        "What evidence establishes whether a designation under this circular is operative for the assessed Fund at the assessment time?"
      ]
    },
